ServerSentinel

This product includes software developed by ServerSentinel contributors.

This software is based in part on the work of the Independent JPEG Group
(libjpeg-turbo, statically linked into the simplejpeg Python wheel used for MJPG
decoding on the Main Server; see server/docs/BACKEND_THIRD_PARTY_LICENSE_TEXTS.md).

Development/CI tooling is listed in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md. Runtime dependencies
and model artifacts require separate review before introduction.
